{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17108289","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17108289","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1710828901:1":{"text":"队长！感谢艾雅，您把大家都带出来了！","source_cn":"队长！感谢艾雅，您把大家都带出来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8A3EAF4DEBE58FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710828902:1":{"text":"我们在剧场附近设置了路障，魔物一时半会儿攻不上来。","source_cn":"我们在剧场附近设置了路障，魔物一时半会儿攻不上来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x069E854001C3AC80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710828903:1":{"text":"很好。受伤的民众记得安排治疗。","source_cn":"很好。受伤的民众记得安排治疗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFCAC7260D0EF187","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710828904:1":{"text":"请您放心。但是……队长，还有一个紧急情况——","source_cn":"请您放心。但是……队长，还有一个紧急情况——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x263FC1AA5D4F893C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710828905:1":{"text":"刚刚收到求救信号，在广场西南侧和圣古堂前的桥上，还有两批没来得及撤离的民众被困住了！","source_cn":"刚刚收到求救信号，在广场西南侧和圣古堂前的桥上，还有两...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x859336B39076C7BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","documen